            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who is the man so wise that he can understand this? To whom has the mouth of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoken, that he may declare it? Why is the land ruined and laid waste like a wilderness, so that no one passes through? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says: “Because they have forsaken my law which I set before them, and have not obeyed my voice, or walked in accord with it, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but have stubbornly followed their own hearts and have gone after the Baals, as their fathers taught them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " of hosts, the God of Israel: Behold, I will feed this people with wormwood, and give them poisonous water to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them among the nations whom neither they nor their fathers have known; and I will send the sword after them, until I have consumed them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
