          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Behold, the days are coming, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I will punish all those who are circumcised but yet uncircumcised— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
